    <item>
      <title>Encontros com Futuro 2026</title>
      <link>https://formcan.publico.pt/frv14i3lu69?sid=sr4b71e4710a42457eae79ab053d280f7c&amp;utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_startups-fundraising</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://adamastor.blog/events#event-1264</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 09:20:40 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>Os Encontros com Futuro, uma conferência promovida pelo PÚBLICO e pela REN, terá a sua 4.ª edição no dia 25 de Setembro, Fundação de Serralves, Porto - data em que se assinala o Dia Nacional da Sustentabilidade.

 

Nesta 4ª edição, reflectimos sobre o ESG num contexto global de crescente instabilidade, tensão geopolítica e transformação acelerada. Entre novas prioridades, risco e capacidade de adaptação, debatemos o papel do ESG na forma como empresas e sociedade respondem aos desafios do prese</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>When:</strong> Friday, 25 September 2026 at 09:00<br><strong>Where:</strong> Porto</p><p>Os Encontros com Futuro, uma conferência promovida pelo PÚBLICO e pela REN, terá a sua 4.ª edição no dia 25 de Setembro, Fundação de Serralves, Porto - data em que se assinala o Dia Nacional da Sustentabilidade.<br><br> <br><br>Nesta 4ª edição, reflectimos sobre o ESG num contexto global de crescente instabilidade, tensão geopolítica e transformação acelerada. Entre novas prioridades, risco e capacidade de adaptação, debatemos o papel do ESG na forma como empresas e sociedade respondem aos desafios do presente e do futuro.<br><br>25 de Setembro; Fundação Serralves, Porto</p><p><a href="https://formcan.publico.pt/frv14i3lu69?sid=sr4b71e4710a42457eae79ab053d280f7c&amp;utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_startups-fundraising">View event details and RSVP →</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>SKYHACK by LX launch</title>
      <link>https://luma.com/my6uey6n?utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_startups-fundraising</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://adamastor.blog/events#event-1189</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 15:55:48 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>Welcome to SKYHACK 🐱

Lisbon&apos;s one-day hackathon by LX Launch. We put 50 of the sharpest builders in one room and give them 10 hours to turn a rough idea into something that actually runs. You&apos;ll work alongside mentors, founders and engineers from across Lisbon&apos;s tech scene: the people who can help bring your ideas to life. Bring curiosity, we bring the rest.
Powered by Cursor, and brought into the sky by LX Launch. ☁️
With Lisbon AI Week, Impact Hub Lisbon, and Build Up Labs as Community Partn</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://images.lumacdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=cover,dpr=1,anim=false,background=white,quality=75,width=800,height=420/event-social/mw/44314374-7ebd-4c77-9ecb-c5041eb3f118.png" alt="" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;"></p><p><strong>When:</strong> Saturday, 26 September 2026 at 08:00<br><strong>Where:</strong> Lisboa</p><p>Welcome to SKYHACK 🐱<br><br>Lisbon&apos;s one-day hackathon by LX Launch. We put 50 of the sharpest builders in one room and give them 10 hours to turn a rough idea into something that actually runs. You&apos;ll work alongside mentors, founders and engineers from across Lisbon&apos;s tech scene: the people who can help bring your ideas to life. Bring curiosity, we bring the rest.<br>Powered by Cursor, and brought into the sky by LX Launch. ☁️<br>With Lisbon AI Week, Impact Hub Lisbon, and Build Up Labs as Community Partners. <br><br>Who&apos;s it for<br>Everyone. Students, Developers, designers, founders, healthcare professionals and anyone curious about building.  🚀<br><br>The details<br>September 26, 2026<br>Impact Hub, Lisbon<br>50 hackers<br>Free to join<br>€4.5K in prizes</p><p><a href="https://luma.com/my6uey6n?utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_startups-fundraising">View event details and RSVP →</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
    </item>
