    <item>
      <title>Growth &amp; Acquisition Night @SBC Summit - SBC Week Kick-Off: Industry Talks × Curated Networking × Party</title>
      <link>https://luma.com/k4u7uwsj?utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_startups-fundraising</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://adamastor.blog/events#event-1234</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 11:26:51 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>Hey Lisbon, kick off SBC Summit Week with industry talks, curated networking, drinks, music and a party — bringing together the people driving growth across the global iGaming ecosystem.
Growth &amp; Acquisition Night connects gaming operators, affiliate leaders, performance marketers, CRM and MarTech companies, agencies, publishers and technology providers for an evening focused on the next generation of player acquisition, retention and performance marketing.
The conversation will explore how gami</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://images.lumacdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=cover,dpr=1,anim=false,background=white,quality=75,width=800,height=420/event-social/3v/a93b08fa-3531-4ccd-8c5e-ac99fa70155b.png" alt="" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;"></p><p><strong>When:</strong> Monday, 28 September 2026 at 18:00<br><strong>Where:</strong> Lisboa</p><p>Hey Lisbon, kick off SBC Summit Week with industry talks, curated networking, drinks, music and a party — bringing together the people driving growth across the global iGaming ecosystem.<br>Growth &amp; Acquisition Night connects gaming operators, affiliate leaders, performance marketers, CRM and MarTech companies, agencies, publishers and technology providers for an evening focused on the next generation of player acquisition, retention and performance marketing.<br>The conversation will explore how gaming companies acquire, convert and retain players in an increasingly competitive market — from affiliate partnerships and paid acquisition to CRM, personalization, attribution, data and AI-powered marketing.<br>Industry talks × curated networking × party<br>What to Expect<br>🎤 Industry Talks<br>Focused conversations around player acquisition, conversion, retention and the technologies changing how gaming companies grow.<br>⚡ Technology Showcases<br>Selected partners and technology companies presenting solutions for the growth and acquisition side of iGaming.<br>🤝 Curated Networking<br>Meet operators, affiliates, publishers, performance marketers, MarTech companies, agencies and technology providers from across the gaming ecosystem.<br>🎧 Networking Party<br>After the content programme, stay for drinks, music and extended networking as we kick off SBC Summit Week in Lisbon.<br>🎙 Speakers<br>Coming soon.<br>🤝 Partners<br>Finnovation Night is made possible through collaboration with our ecosystem partners, sponsors and local fintech communities.<br>Event Format<br>18:30 — Doors open, welcome drinks &amp; networking<br>19:15 — Opening and industry conversation<br>19:30 — Panel  fireside chat: The New Playbook for Player Acquisition &amp; Retention<br>20:10 — Selected partner  technology showcases<br>20:30–00:00 — Networking party, drinks &amp; music<br>📍 Where the Night Happens - The Station by SEXTO<br>We’re taking over The Station by SEXTO, a two-level Lisbon venue with multiple spaces for conversations, drinks, music and dancing.<br><br>About TechEmbassy<br>TechEmbassy builds curated communities around the world&apos;s leading technology conferences, creating meaningful connections between founders, enterprises, investors and industry experts.<br>Growth &amp; Acquisition Night Lisbon is part of our Global Series - explore the full calendar of our events around the world at https://techembassy.org/<br>🌐 Website: https://techembassy.org/<br>📅 Events calendar: https://luma.com/techembassy.org<br>💼 LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/company/tech-embassy/</p><p><a href="https://luma.com/k4u7uwsj?utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_startups-fundraising">View event details and RSVP →</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Above Lisbon: A Sunset App-eritif</title>
      <link>https://luma.com/fkz3jb0d?utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_startups-fundraising</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://adamastor.blog/events#event-1235</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 11:59:01 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>By Tuesday, Lisbon belongs to SBC — badges, back-to-backs, and busy halls.
The evening before, join Tappx, Adjust &amp; Asapty for Above Lisbon: A Sunset App-eritif 🌞 🍷
We’re hosting an exclusive group of app industry leaders for fine Portuguese wines, curated local bites, and stunning golden-hour views over Lisbon’s terracotta rooftops. 

No stage, no slides, no pitches — just great drinks, beautiful views, and even better company ✨

Sunset time at 19:21 🌅
Come for golden hour, stay for the even</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://images.lumacdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=cover,dpr=1,anim=false,background=white,quality=75,width=800,height=420/event-social/h4/d3d32272-49e3-4a57-9ab9-9ce23a8970d7.png" alt="" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;"></p><p><strong>When:</strong> Monday, 28 September 2026 at 18:30<br><strong>Where:</strong> Lisboa</p><p>By Tuesday, Lisbon belongs to SBC — badges, back-to-backs, and busy halls.<br>The evening before, join Tappx, Adjust &amp; Asapty for Above Lisbon: A Sunset App-eritif 🌞 🍷<br>We’re hosting an exclusive group of app industry leaders for fine Portuguese wines, curated local bites, and stunning golden-hour views over Lisbon’s terracotta rooftops. <br><br>No stage, no slides, no pitches — just great drinks, beautiful views, and even better company ✨<br><br>Sunset time at 19:21 🌅<br>Come for golden hour, stay for the evening.<br>This is an invitation-only event with limited capacity. All registrations are subject to approval.</p><p><a href="https://luma.com/fkz3jb0d?utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_startups-fundraising">View event details and RSVP →</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Workshop #1 - Pitch to Win</title>
      <link>https://app.crewofbuilders.com/events/workshop-1-pitch-to-win-8776?utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_startups-fundraising</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://adamastor.blog/events#event-1283</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 16:20:23 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>If you&apos;re raising — or getting ready to — this one&apos;s for you. Felipe and Daniel are going to walk through what makes a deck land: how to open it, what to cut, and what an investor is actually looking for.

We&apos;ll go through:

→ How to do a 5-minute pitch
→ Which slides actually matter
→ How to tell the story before the numbers
→ What to show when the traction is still small
→ How to make the ask

It&apos;s less presentation, more working session. Bring your deck if you have one, or just the part you&apos;r</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://app.crewofbuilders.com/assets/pitch-to-win-banner-v2.png" alt="" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;"></p><p><strong>When:</strong> Tuesday, 29 September 2026 at 13:00<br><strong>Where:</strong> Online</p><p>If you&apos;re raising — or getting ready to — this one&apos;s for you. Felipe and Daniel are going to walk through what makes a deck land: how to open it, what to cut, and what an investor is actually looking for.<br><br>We&apos;ll go through:<br><br>→ How to do a 5-minute pitch<br>→ Which slides actually matter<br>→ How to tell the story before the numbers<br>→ What to show when the traction is still small<br>→ How to make the ask<br><br>It&apos;s less presentation, more working session. Bring your deck if you have one, or just the part you&apos;re stuck on — reply to your confirmation email with your question and we&apos;ll make sure it gets covered.</p><p><a href="https://app.crewofbuilders.com/events/workshop-1-pitch-to-win-8776?utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_startups-fundraising">View event details and RSVP →</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
    </item>
    <item>
