    <item>
      <title>NOVA Matchmaking Event</title>
      <link>https://luma.com/gr0l1xr8?utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_startups-fundraising</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://adamastor.blog/events#event-1268</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 17:49:03 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>What if your next co-founder is studying at a different NOVA school?
The NOVA Matchmaking Event is back.
Organized by NOVA Impact and NOVA FCSH, this event brings together students and researchers from across NOVA’s 10 schools who are interested in entrepreneurship, innovation, and new ideas.
Whether you have a project and are looking for people to join you, want to find a co-founder or teammate, are interested in joining an existing project, or simply want to meet people outside your usual circ</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://images.lumacdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=cover,dpr=1,anim=false,background=white,quality=75,width=800,height=420/event-social/i5/764a79f8-8a47-40dd-8300-bdeec869edac.png" alt="" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;"></p><p><strong>When:</strong> Thursday, 15 October 2026 at 16:00<br><strong>Where:</strong> Lisboa</p><p>What if your next co-founder is studying at a different NOVA school?<br>The NOVA Matchmaking Event is back.<br>Organized by NOVA Impact and NOVA FCSH, this event brings together students and researchers from across NOVA’s 10 schools who are interested in entrepreneurship, innovation, and new ideas.<br>Whether you have a project and are looking for people to join you, want to find a co-founder or teammate, are interested in joining an existing project, or simply want to meet people outside your usual circle, this event is for you.<br>You do not need a startup, a business plan, or even a fully formed idea. Just bring your curiosity.<br>What to expect<br>A selection of short startup and project pitches<br>Structured matchmaking activity<br>Time to talk, mingle, and follow up with people you meet<br>Drinks and nibbles<br>If you have a project, you can indicate in the registration form that you would like to pitch. We will review pitch requests and contact selected participants by email before the event.<br>Who can join?<br>All NOVA Bachelor’s, Master’s, and PhD students, as well as researchers, staff, and faculty from any of NOVA’s 10 schools. NOVA alumni who graduated in 2024 or later are also welcome to join.<br>Find more info at our website.<br>Your next co-founder might be closer than you think.<br>Register by 13th of October 11.59am!</p><p><a href="https://luma.com/gr0l1xr8?utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_startups-fundraising">View event details and RSVP →</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
    </item>
