13:00 – 14:00 | Lunch (venue to be announced)
Whether you&apos;re new to Lisbon, building somethin</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://og.luma.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=cover,dpr=1,anim=false,background=white,quality=75,width=800,height=420/event?calendar_avatar=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.lumacdn.com%2Fcalendars%2F21%2F14cd8085-02ba-42a6-8d43-55f20a42babd.jpg&amp;calendar_name=Unicorn%20Factory%20Lisboa&amp;color0=%23f92c64&amp;color1=%23ffffff&amp;color2=%23fda6bd&amp;color3=%23fb668e&amp;host_avatar=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.lumacdn.com%2Favatars%2F7f%2Ffaa44d23-c9a1-44e3-b8ab-ac9bdb3c72e1&amp;host_name=Unicorn%20Factory%20Lisboa&amp;img=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.lumacdn.com%2Fevent-covers%2F2q%2F8fe47dad-0cd9-4816-adfb-d8f5ba432cdf.jpg&amp;name=Expats%20in%20Tech%20Lunch%20%7C%20Fall%20Edition&amp;palette_neutral=%23ffffff%3A7.97&amp;palette_vibrant=%23f92c64%3A90.66" alt="" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;"></p><p><strong>When:</strong> Thursday, 22 October 2026 at 12:30<br><strong>Where:</strong> Lisboa</p><p>🌎 For expats and international entrepreneurs living in Lisbon or recently arrived, curious about the city’s startup and innovation scene, this special gathering is for you!<br>Join us for this Fall Expats in Tech Lunch Edition, bringing together Lisbon’s international tech community to share an informal lunch at Beato Innovation District.<br>📍 Agenda<br>12:30 – 13:00 | Beato Innovation District Tour (optional)<br>13:00 – 14:00 | Lunch (venue to be announced)<br>Whether you&apos;re new to Lisbon, building something in tech, or simply curious about the local startup ecosystem, this is a great opportunity to connect with fellow expats, exchange experiences, discover innovative startups, and enjoy the energy of Lisbon’s thriving tech community during the summer season. ☀️<br>Price: €30 per person, including lunch.<br>Lunch venue and menu details will be announced soon.</p><p><a href="https://luma.com/v4su2th2?utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_startups-fundraising">View event details and RSVP →</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
