13:00 – 14:30 | L</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://images.lumacdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=cover,dpr=1,anim=false,background=white,quality=75,width=800,height=420/event-social/4u/d10dbf43-ce23-4a56-af02-27e80c3a75ba.png" alt="" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;"></p><p><strong>When:</strong> Friday, 30 October 2026 at 12:30<br><strong>Where:</strong> Lisboa</p><p>🌎 For expats and international entrepreneurs living in Lisbon or recently arrived, curious about the city’s startup and innovation scene, this special gathering is for you!<br>Join us at the Health Hub, one of the newest hubs in the Unicorn Factory Lisboa ecosystem for this Fall Expats in Tech Lunch Edition, bringing together Lisbon’s international tech community to share an informal lunch.<br>📍 Agenda<br>12:30 – 13:00 | Welcoming at Health Hub &amp; Introduction to Unicorn Factory Lisboa<br>13:00 – 14:30 | Lunch (venue to be announced)<br>Whether you&apos;re new to Lisbon, building something in tech, or simply curious about the local startup ecosystem, this is a great opportunity to connect with fellow expats, exchange experiences, discover innovative startups, and enjoy the energy of Lisbon’s thriving tech community during the fall season.<br>Price: €35 per person, including lunch.<br>Lunch venue and menu details will be announced soon.</p><p><a href="https://luma.com/v4su2th2?utm_source=adamastor.blog&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_events_startups-fundraising">View event details and RSVP →</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
